/-!
# Some results on TI-sets (Aschbacher--Smith, I.6--I.8)

The elementary TI criteria and the uniqueness criterion I.6.1 are re-exported
here. The tightly embedded subgroup and recognition results have distinct
proof branches: the former use finite 2-group theory, while the latter require
the recognition of groups generated by product-disconnected involutions.

Source: Aschbacher--Smith, *The Classification of Quasithin Groups*, combined
1 March 2004 manuscript, printed pp. 424--430.
-/
